    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687130/extras/7dfab1c0d043a7640d60796765ba39b7.avif?t=1654676926\" /></div><br><br>Previously under the title of <u>SYNDER</u>.<br><br>T\u0314\u0350\u036b\u0358\u0345\u0324\u0326\u0330\u031f\u0345\u0349\u0330h\u0369\u0314\u031a\u036c\u035f\u031c\u031d\u032d\u0325\u032ee\u0367\u0357\u0367\u0328\u0325\u032f\u0353\u0323 \u0312\u030d\u0358\u032f\u0317\u031d\u0347\u032e\u0317\u0349D\u0303\u0343\u0311\u0337\u035a\u0319\u0316\u034e\u0316\u0325\u0356\u0323e\u0363\u0351\u0328\u0316\u0330a\u0365\u0301\u0346\u0304\u035e\u034d\u0356\u035a\u0324\u032cd\u036f\u0335\u0355\u033b\u031c\u035a\u034d\u033b\u0331 \u030c\u036f\u0369\u033e\u0341\u0349\u031e\u0354R\u0350\u0336\u032c\u0349\u034d\u032d\u0330\u0330\u033bo\u0300\u033d\u036f\u0361\u0347\u0356\u032a\u032b\u035a\u0324\u0339\u034do\u030b\u0335\u0348\u034d\u0326\u0347\u0354\u0326m\u0365\u034a\u0302\u0322\u0317\u0349s\u034b\u0307\u034b\u0313\u0362\u0318\u0318\u0355\u0332\u0319\u0359\u0355\u0349 have taken you. Push through, what seems as an enigmatic living dimension extending randomly for eternity.<br><br><br>Experience dread and isolation as you navigate a seemingly endless realm of rooms, search for supplies/weapons and maintain your sanity as you hope for an exit.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">IT'S LIKE THE FIRST TIME, EVERYTIME!</h2>The Dead Rooms is ever evolving and adapting, Every run will feature different rooms and layouts + loot, and offer a different playthrough<br>Sometime you may get lucky..<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687130/extras/65b543ac1a22718279cc7e36a9b9487b.poster.avif?t=1654676926\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687130/extras/65b543ac1a22718279cc7e36a9b9487b.webm?t=1654676926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687130/extras/65b543ac1a22718279cc7e36a9b9487b.mp4?t=1654676926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NO MORE WALKING SIMULATORS!</h2>The Dead Rooms aims to be an <strong>actually game</strong>, not just an immersive experience. Featuring survival and roguelite mechanics such as character management and <strong>perma death</strong> with the chance to find your previous body on your next run!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LEVEL VARIETY!</h2>As you progress further, The Dead Rooms will feature a variety of rooms featured in The Back Rooms Lore, more being added after release! <br><strong>Below are planned with more on the way!</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Level 0 - &quot;The Lobby&quot;</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687130/extras/5eaf73144421fb87b45ba6f6b6d34412.poster.avif?t=1654676926\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687130/extras/5eaf73144421fb87b45ba6f6b6d34412.webm?t=1654676926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687130/extras/5eaf73144421fb87b45ba6f6b6d34412.mp4?t=1654676926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Level 427 - &quot;Infinite Mall&quot;</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687130/extras/df2708734bac6441d2b9640f093981f7.poster.avif?t=1654676926\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687130/extras/df2708734bac6441d2b9640f093981f7.webm?t=1654676926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687130/extras/df2708734bac6441d2b9640f093981f7.mp4?t=1654676926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Level 239 - &quot;Infinite Arcade&quot;</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687130/extras/311e964d30b22d4feec2c7a3d2ba7347.poster.avif?t=1654676926\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687130/extras/311e964d30b22d4feec2c7a3d2ba7347.webm?t=1654676926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687130/extras/311e964d30b22d4feec2c7a3d2ba7347.mp4?t=1654676926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Level 974 - &quot;Kitty's House&quot;</h2></li></ul>",
